title: repos:toggle-memory
tags: [[GUI command]] Repository
kind: reference
summary: Repos: hold a repository in memory, or let go of it

Holds the store of a loaded repository — the one named, else the active one — in memory, or lets go of it if it already is, without unloading it; the status bar says which, and why it is not locked when it is not ([[Holding a repository in memory]]).
